{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Your dwelling</b> — three times in the Masorah: here, and the other two: יהיה משכך (shall be your dwelling) and ונפקדתי כי יפקד משבך (and I will visit, when your dwelling is visited). Even though [in the first] it is משמני ארץ משבך (from the fat of the earth your dwelling) — יפקד משבך (your dwelling shall be visited) — כי יבא אשור וישבך (when Assyria comes and settles you)."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {0 "The third occurrence's reading is uncertain; the phrase כי יבא אשור וישבך may be a paraphrastic juxtaposition rather than a verbatim Masorah citation."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:07.327588165Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}